msgid ""
"Overflow Flag: Set when an arithmetic operation produces a result that "
"cannot be represented in signed 8-bit range (-128 to +127). Used for "
"detecting signed arithmetic errors in calculations."
msgstr ""
"Overflow Flag: Wird gesetzt, wenn eine arithmetische Operation ein Ergebnis "
